furusato:Donation rdfs:comment "Synthetic static baseline hometown-tax Donation row (ふるさと納税の寄付／寄附) and the only static fact grain for transaction counts and JPY amounts. It is an independent snapshot, not an approved, promoted, deduplicated, or finalized form of an Eventhouse observation. Each entity links to exactly one Donor, one recipient Municipality, and one selected Gift option in this dataset." .
