furusato:Gift rdf:type owl:Class .
furusato:Gift rdfs:comment "Synthetic return-gift option selected by a Donation (返礼品／お礼品／商品). It is a catalog dimension, not the donated money and not a transaction fact. If a Municipality is named, resolve that Municipality and traverse MunicipalityCatalogsGift before applying a GiftName CONTAINS candidate filter. Resolve exactly one stable GiftId before Supplier or Donation traversal." .
