furusato:Gift__GiftName rdfs:comment "Core Japanese product or service name of the return-gift option (返礼品名／お礼品名／商品名). It usually opens with a place-of-origin word such as a prefecture name, which is display text and not authoritative geography. For a Municipality-qualified colloquial label, traverse MunicipalityCatalogsGift first, filter this property with CONTAINS on the core noun, and verify the remaining numeric and descriptive tokens. Core names can repeat, so resolve one stable GiftId before further traversal." .
