furusato:SupplierProvidesGift rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift rdfs:comment "Connects a Supplier, provider, vendor, 事業者, 業者, or 会社 to a Gift for which it is a registered provider. It does not prove an actual fulfillment, service, shipment, or physical origin. For a Gift-centered provider question, resolve the GiftId first and traverse this relationship in reverse from Gift to every registered Supplier, then use SupplierInPrefecture for registered location. The registration contract is many-to-many and optional on both sides: a Gift may have zero, one or many Suppliers and a Supplier may register zero, one or many Gifts. In this dataset every one of the 2,500 Suppliers and all 6,000 Gifts participate, across 14,514 unique pairs, so no orphan appears at run time. No allocation of DonationAmountYen among Suppliers is defined." .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift rdfs:domain furusato:Supplier .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift rdfs:label "SupplierProvidesGift" .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift rdfs:range furusato:Gift .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift fabric:aggregationGuard "do not sum DonationAmountYen across Suppliers without an explicit allocation rule because multi-supplier Gifts can duplicate attribution" .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift fabric:businessRole "catalog supply relationship" .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift fabric:cardinality "many-to-many, zero-to-many on both sides by contract" .
furusato:SupplierProvidesGift fabric:definitionJson "{\"$schema\":\"https://developer.microsoft.com/json-schemas/fabric/item/ontology/relationshipType/1.0.0/schema.json\",\"id\":\"5548279086455910756\",\"name\":\"SupplierProvidesGift\",\"namespace\":\"usertypes\",\"namespaceType\":\"Custom\",\"semanticEnrichment\":{\"customAttributes\":{\"aggregationGuard\":\"do not sum DonationAmountYen across Suppliers without an explicit allocation rule because multi-supplier Gifts can duplicate attribution\",\"businessRole\":\"catalog supply relationship\",\"cardinality\":\"many-to-many, zero-to-many on both sides by contract\",\"direction\":\"Supplier -> Gift\",\"grain\":\"one unique Supplier-Gift pair\",\"sensitivity\":\"Public-Synthetic-Catalog\",\"sourceParticipation\":\"optional by contract; total in this dataset - 0 Suppliers without a Gift\",\"targetParticipation\":\"optional by contract; total in this dataset - 0 Gifts without a Supplier\"},\"description\":\"Connects a Supplier, provider, vendor, 事業者, 業者, or 会社 to a Gift for which it is a registered provider. It does not prove an actual fulfillment, service, shipment, or physical origin. For a Gift-centered provider question, resolve the GiftId first and traverse this relationship in reverse from Gift to every registered Supplier, then use SupplierInPrefecture for registered location. The registration contract is many-to-many and optional on both sides: a Gift may have zero, one or many Suppliers and a Supplier may register zero, one or many Gifts. In this dataset every one of the 2,500 Suppliers and all 6,000 Gifts participate, across 14,514 unique pairs, so no orphan appears at run time. No allocation of DonationAmountYen among Suppliers is defined.\"},\"source\":{\"entityTypeId\":\"193544498857107\"},\"target\":{\"entityTypeId\":\"21065477330866\"}}" .
